  "detailed_description": "The “Distribution of Nuclear Poly Hedrosis Virus” scheme by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, provides subsidies for the distribution of Nuclear Poly Hedrosis Virus (NPV) to farmers raising seed farms with Pulses crops.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The beneficiary should be a Farmer.\n  - The beneficiary should be a resident of Tamil Nadu.\n  - The beneficiary should raise seed farms with Pulses crops.\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
